{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Roaring Knight — the masked Knight\n\nServes 'The Roaring'. Susie confirms he's a Lightner after seeing him at night.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Prophecy**\nDirect antagonist of the prophetic text.","x":390,"y":-70,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**King**\nGets from Jevil the idea of his 'genius' and a path to power.","x":-130,"y":398,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/King_Battle (2).gif","x":-129,"y":758,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Profecy.gif","x":430,"y":-440,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Dess**\nDominant theory: she's the one under the mask.","x":-1480,"y":513,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Dess.png","x":-1525,"y":30,"width":91,"height":190},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**The black deer in the retro minigame (Ch.3)**\nAn enemy from the Original Game in the Sword Route hides, behind a variable named toriel, an unused sprite of a black deer — almost universally believed to represent Dess.","x":-772,"y":758,"width":270,"height":190,"color":"1"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":-73,"y":-270,"width":166,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Knight_screenshot_Asgore_captured.png","x":-620,"y":-560,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Ch.4 cliffhanger**\nKidnaps Undyne and flees to the Shelter; the doors close.","x":-600,"y":-230,"width":270,"height":150,"color":"3"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Asriel** A real alternative theory (not just speculation): the 'wiffle' bat = the discarded \"Asriel's Bat\" item from UT; attacks that avoid/soften damage to Kris; shared pose gestures; Tenna's favorite changes to \"Sword Magician\". Against: the horns look more like the Holidays' than a Dreemurr's.","x":800,"y":528,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/asriel_roaringknight.webp","x":875,"y":138,"width":151,"height":190},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Kris's complicity**\nThe Knight has attack patterns designed not to hurt (or to hurt much less) Kris, while knocking out Ralsei and Susie normally — suggesting Kris cooperates with the Knight in some way.","x":800,"y":-350,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"3"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/kris_Knight_overworld_knighting.gif","x":875,"y":-580,"width":200,"height":149},{"id":"s_patron_deliberado","type":"text","text":"**A deliberate pattern, or coincidence?**\nThree attempts, three members of the Dreemurr family/their close circle (Toriel, Undyne, Asgore). Is he trying to silence someone who \"knows too much,\" or have the kidnappings targeted this family specifically from the start?","x":-1525,"y":1028,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"3"},{"id":"s_carol_rudy","type":"text","text":"**Carol and Rudy Holiday**\nMuch weaker speculation than the Dess or Asriel theories, with barely any direct textual evidence — mentioned more as a remote possibility than as a theory with real weight.","x":-1185,"y":1028,"width":320,"height":200,"color":"1"},{"id":"s_carol_rudy-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_Holiday.webp","x":-1185,"y":818,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s_patron_deliberado-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Knight_screenshot_confront_with_kriss_cap4.png","x":-1733,"y":1261,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/black_deer.png","x":-908,"y":1063,"width":110,"height":130}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s2","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e-s0-s5","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s6","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"s6-img-e","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s_patron_deliberado","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_patron_deliberado","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s_carol_rudy","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_carol_rudy","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_carol_rudy-img","fromNode":"s_carol_rudy-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s_carol_rudy","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s_patron_deliberado-img","fromNode":"s_patron_deliberado-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s_patron_deliberado","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s5","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"}]}